le over 2gb were found to still leak memori buffer releas logic is be refactor to releas buffer after each chunk clickup task ciph 41 sourc id src cu ciph 41 task id ciph 41 titl stream chunk multi gb pdf load without retain buffer status activ reopen assigne charli prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 12 activ histori 2026 08 12 alic task creat open open the task becaus larg file chunk is need for multi gb document 2026 08 20 charli buffer releas refactor activ reopen\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96b7f688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"id\": \"7fab92c2892cd73f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.39840988146251954, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2141856163750279, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8282665, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96b7f688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1122, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:41\", \"token_count\": 577, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \" - *Refactoring stream buffer release after each chunk after the task was reopened when files 2GB and larger were still found to leak memory.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"refactor stream buffer releas after each chunk after the task wa reopen when file 2gb and larger were still found to leak memori\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96b7f688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"documen